				<h2 style="font-size: 28px; color: #1565c0; margin-top: 30px;">Examination Overview - NISM Series IX: Merchant Banking Certification</h2>
<br />
<p style="color: #000;">
The NISM-Series-IX: Merchant Banking Certification Examination is designed to create a minimum knowledge benchmark for employees working with SEBI-registered Merchant Bankers. It is especially relevant for professionals who:
</p>
<div style="color: #000;">
  <p><img src="images/BULLET.png" style="vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 8px;" /> Work on SEBI-regulated activities such as IPOs, FPOs, Buy-backs, Open Offers, and Delisting.</p>
  <p><img src="images/BULLET.png" style="vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 8px;" /> Interact with issuers or intermediaries involved in such transactions.</p>
  <p><img src="images/BULLET.png" style="vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 8px;" /> Act as Compliance Officers submitting Due Diligence Certificates to SEBI.</p>
</div>
<p style="color: #000;">
The exam ensures a sound understanding of capital market functions, regulatory frameworks, merchant banking processes, and SEBI regulations for efficient and compliant execution of responsibilities.
</p>

<h2 style="font-size: 22px; color: #1565c0; margin-top: 30px;">Examination Objectives</h2>
<br />
<p style="color: #000;">Upon successful completion, the candidate should be able to:</p>
<div>
  <p style="color: #000;"><img src="images/BULLET.png" alt="" style="vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 8px;" /> Understand the basics of Merchant Banking in India and its evolving scope.</p>
  <p style="color: #000;"><img src="images/BULLET.png" alt="" style="vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 8px;" /> Grasp issue management processes, takeovers, delisting, and buybacks under SEBI norms.</p>
  <p style="color: #000;"><img src="images/BULLET.png" alt="" style="vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 8px;" /> Know the regulatory environment and due diligence responsibilities handled by Merchant Bankers.</p>
</div>

<div style="border: 1px solid #90caf9; background-color: #e3f2fd; padding: 5px 8px; border-radius: 5px; margin: 20px 0;">
  <p style="color: #000; font-size: 14px; margin: 0;">
    For more details, please visit the official website of 
    <a href="https://www.nism.ac.in/" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color: #0000f8;"><strong>NISM</strong></a>.
  </p>
</div>

<h2 style="font-size: 22px; color: #1565c0;">Assessment Structure</h2>
<br />
<table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-bottom: 30px;">
  <thead>
    <tr style="background-color: #e3f2fd;">
      <th style="border: 1px solid #90caf9; padding: 8px;">Component</th>
      <th style="border: 1px solid #90caf9; padding: 8px;">Details</th>
    </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody style="color: #000;">
    <tr><td style="border: 1px solid #bbdefb; padding: 8px;">Number of Questions</td><td style="border: 1px solid #bbdefb; padding: 8px;">100</td></tr>
    <tr><td style="border: 1px solid #bbdefb; padding: 8px;">Marks per Question</td><td style="border: 1px solid #bbdefb; padding: 8px;">1 mark</td></tr>
